WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:02,850
Your Majesty, the Martial Arts Queen

2
00:00:04,670 --> 00:00:05,670
How was your return?

3
00:00:05,790 --> 00:00:07,150
Didn't you live well by following me?

4
00:00:07,590 --> 00:00:08,510
Big changes in the base

5
00:00:08,750 --> 00:00:10,990
The military headquarters was reorganized into base guards.

6
00:00:10,990 --> 00:00:12,070
It's not that you said it wrong

7
00:00:12,070 --> 00:00:13,110
You got it all right

8
00:00:13,310 --> 00:00:14,270
Not to mention food

9
00:00:14,430 --> 00:00:15,510
It can't be compared with the one at my eldest sister's house.

10
00:00:17,310 --> 00:00:28,380
The space is delicate and can support the elder sister

11
00:00:29,020 --> 00:00:29,980
I used to eat your food

12
00:00:29,980 --> 00:00:31,780
Today you eat our food together

13
00:00:32,180 --> 00:00:36,740
I'm not hungry

14
00:00:37,220 --> 00:00:38,190
I'll give you this too

15
00:00:38,310 --> 00:00:39,350
Meal for five people

16
00:00:39,350 --> 00:00:40,350
Eats for seven people

17
00:00:40,670 --> 00:00:42,700
He took out all the eggs

18
00:00:42,940 --> 00:00:43,970
these days

19
00:00:44,370 --> 00:00:46,980
Who can eat eggs and Yang Zi?
